erste_meldung:
Type mismatch: After simplification, term
  Tendsto.comp (Continuous.tendsto continuous_re ↑‖f‖) h
 has type
  @Tendsto A ℝ (re ∘ fun x ↦ f x) l (𝓝 ‖f‖)
but is expected to have type
  @Tendsto A ℝ (fun e ↦ (f e).re) l (𝓝 ‖f‖)

